# Merge after pass

Merge your own PRs on `rnmee/somang-trust-site` only after Mee or Unit 12 says the PR passed review. Never merge before that.

A preview is not the house. Merge attaches the work to `main`. After a pass, squash-merge. Do not send Mee into GitHub as the work. If she pastes a pass, attach it.

If they say `do not merge` on a specific PR, leave it.
